  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1226056,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Block Plot: A Commodore 64 Classic\n\nStep into a mesmerizing world of spatial reasoning with *2 Block Plot*, a unique puzzle game for the Commodore 64! Inspired by the timeless appeal of Tetris, *2 Block Plot* elevates the challenge into a captivating three-dimensional experience.\n\nYou'll manipulate falling polycubes, rotating them around all axes and strategically positioning them within a growing, three-dimensional pit. The goal? To create complete layers and clear the space, preventing the pit from filling up and ending your game. \n\nUnlike Tetris’s row-clearing mechanic, *2 Block Plot* demands a deeper understanding of volume and spatial relationships. Careful planning and quick reflexes are essential as you navigate increasingly complex piece combinations. The game’s vibrant graphics and catchy chiptune soundtrack create an immersive atmosphere, while the escalating difficulty provides a constant test of your puzzle-solving skills. Can you master the art of three-dimensional packing and achieve a high score in *2 Block Plot*?"
    },
